    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1027">

                <pb facs="1154" n="1074" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1074"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 82.]</seg></opener>
                <p>I have to acknowledge the receipt of your two telegrams of the 24th ultimo.</p>
                <p>I inclose for your information copy of a letter from the Acting Secretary of the
                    Navy, forwarding the report made by the commanding officer of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Marietta</hi> on the subject.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



